# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "held-grow-glide"
verdict good
note "growth, first reference: read k0-70: the swap springs the bottom panel 93 -> 191 -> 187 wide from its centre (k1-9) as the long card fades in over the idle row; the quick swaps reverse the fades in flight with the box held at the long card's size; back: the long card fades out (k43-56), then the box springs down to the idle row's 60x35 (k57-65), the row keeping its place on x and gliding 20 -> 29 on y to its rest by the bottom edge; only the shown card at every rest"
date 2026-10-23
rev "94d165c6+changes"
approver "claude"
scenario 20364aa6d1a67173
